sequenceDiagram
 participant U as User
 participant A as API
 participant P as Provider
 participant D as PostgreSQL
 participant Q as Worker/Outbox
 U->>A: Create order + idempotency key
 A->>D: Persist pending order
 A-->>U: Checkout instructions
 U->>P: Checkout
 P->>A: Signed webhook
 A->>A: Verify signature/replay
 A->>P: Verify transaction if required
 A->>D: Transaction: payment + ledger + outbox
 A-->>P: Acknowledge
 Q->>D: Read outbox
 Q-->>U: Receipt/notification
